      "A monochrome/sepia view of a quiet street with several two‑story masonry buildings from the late 19th–early 20th century. The central structure has a gabled facade with three small arched attic windows and many chimneys; the left building has a mansard roof with a dormer. Leafless trees and a low fence run along an unpaved road; no people or vehicles are visible."
